 seemingly is fine he is walking down the  street no third eye no agonizing pain  but then a person comes up behind him  and she calls out to him doctor strange  he turns around looks very confused and  says can i help you she then says you  caused an incursion and we're gonna fix  it she then summons a magical blade and  cuts a rift in their reality to the dark  dimension the same dark dimension that  we saw in the first doctor strange film  where dormammu was she looks into the  dark dimension turns back to doctor  strange and says unless you're afraid in  which doctor strange takes a scarf  throws it over the back of his neck and  it turns into his cloak and entire  doctor strange outfit and he says not in  the least as we see his third eye open  and the two of them jump in now like i  said it doesn't really seem like the  third eye corruption is going to be a  problem for our doctor strange as we see  here doctor strange is completely fine  and he seems to actually be using the  third eye to his advantage now the third  eye in the comics his mystic eye is  actually the eye of agamotto not a  physical eye that he opens from his  forehead so they definitely changed this  up a little bit in the mcu giving it a  little bit of a twist but keep in mind  that the darkhold in every reality has  been destroyed by the scarlet witch so  the risk of him using it and becoming  more corrupt and evil isn't really that  high and he probably realizes this and  figures out a way to make it work to his  advantage now this person is clea i'm  sorry to all the people who thought that  it was psylocke i admit yes that blade  does look like psylocke's but this is  not the x-men psyluck this is clia  doctor strange's romantic interest in  the comics and eventually his wife and  the sorcerer supreme of the dark  dimension and to top it all off she is  actually the niece of dormammu when  khalia was born her mother was actually  banished from the dimension that they  were at so she grew 