llains like doctor doom kang  and whoever else the mcu wants to  introduce before then and at that point  in time we'll have the fantastic four  and the x-men and the mcu as well so  this really is going to be a huge huge  movie when they finally do it way bigger  than avengers infinity war and end game  if you can even believe that but again  incursion is a big part of that because  incursion is what leads to the  destruction of universes and the  multiverse and we have this big  illuminati scene here with mr fantastic  john krasinski as mr fantastic reed  richards explaining the threat of  incursion which was the whole reason  that doctor strange was being judged by  the illuminati so it really does look  like secret wars tends to be the huge  story that marvel studios is eventually  going to lead up to which is really  exciting because we're going to get some  pretty amazing characters and their  variants including god emperor doom and  in doctor strange in the multiverse of  madness we had the introduction of the  x-men and the fantastic four so  hopefully the true main mcu earth 616  x-men and fantastic four are coming soon  now as far as that second post-credit  scene goes we go back to pizza papa  played by bruce campbell during the  movie america chavez goes up to a stand  and gets some pizza balls from him she  thinks they're free because she explains  to doctor strange that food in most  universes is free and it's weird that  his universe makes you pay for food  however she is actually wrong in this  universe you still have to pay for food  so pizza papa wants his money dr strain  casts a spell on him that makes him  start to punch himself in the face and  beat himself up he explains that the  spell will eventually wear out and  america chavez says in like three hours  and he explains well no kind of in like  three weeks so here we are three weeks  later and he finally stops hitting  himself he looks at his hand as it's now  not hitting him laughs hysteric